# home/

Working example screen for ${PROJECT_NAME}. Demonstrates the strict
4-subfolder rule with a tiny `HomeHeader` component, a `useHomeData` hook
backed by TanStack Query, a `home.service.ts` that hits a configurable
`EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL`, and matching `home.types.ts`.

> **Intentionally tiny.** This screen exists to demonstrate the folder
> rule, not to demo auth, real navigation, or push notifications. Do NOT
> expand it — copy `_screen_template/` for new screens.

## The strict 4-subfolder rule

| Subfolder | What lives here | File suffix |
| --- | --- | --- |
| [`components/`](components/) | Screen-local components | `*.tsx` |
| [`hooks/`](hooks/) | Screen-local hooks | `use*.ts` |
| [`services/`](services/) | Business logic / API orchestration | `*.service.ts` |
| [`types/`](types/) | Types local to this screen | `*.types.ts` |

## Files

- [`HomeScreen.tsx`](HomeScreen.tsx) — navigator-registered component. The
  only `.tsx` at the screen root.

